            <h2 class="section-title">LLP Partner Change in Gurugram: Addition, Exit, and Designated Partner Compliance</h2>
            <div class="content-text">
                <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
                    <p><strong>&#128204; TL;DR - LLP Partner Change in Gurugram Services at a Glance</strong></p>
                    <p>To change LLP partners: obtain DPIN/DSC for designated partners, get consent (Form 9), pass partner resolution, draft supplementary deed on Haryana stamp paper, file Form 4 (partner change) + Form 3 (agreement amendment) with ROC Haryana within 30 days. Both forms always required. Minimum 2 designated partners (1 Indian resident) must be maintained. Late filing: Rs 100/day per form, NO cap.</p>
                </div>
                <p>Gurugram LLPs frequently change partners as businesses evolve. For a comprehensive overview, see our <a href="/llp-partner-change">LLP Partner Change</a> national guide.</p><div class="table-responsive-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Change Type</th><th>Process</th><th>Forms Required</th><th>Timeline</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Partner Addition</td><td>DPIN + consent + resolution + deed</td><td>Form 4 + Form 3</td><td>7-14 days</td></tr><tr><td>Partner Resignation/Exit</td><td>Notice + resolution + settlement + deed</td><td>Form 4 + Form 3</td><td>7-14 days</td></tr><tr><td>Designated Partner Change</td><td>DPIN + Form 9 + resolution + deed</td><td>Form 4 + Form 3</td><td>7-10 days</td></tr><tr><td>NRI/Foreign Partner</td><td>FEMA + DPIN (passport) + DSC + deed</td><td>Form 4 + Form 3 + FEMA</td><td>10-21 days</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p</p>
                <p>ROC Haryana at Chandigarh (from 16 Feb 2026) processes all Form 4 filings. Patron manages end-to-end: DPIN/DSC, consent, supplementary deed on Haryana stamp paper, coordinated Form 4 + Form 3, and NRI/foreign partner FEMA compliance.</p>
                <p>Content is reviewed quarterly for accuracy.</p>
